---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="AfLux — Local-First Tax & Financial Co-Pilot">
  <style>
    .hero { text-align: center; padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.75rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1.125rem; color: #525252; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .hero-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.15s; }
    .btn-primary { background: #171717; color: white; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #404040; text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-secondary { background: white; color: #171717; border: 1px solid #d4d4d4; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #a3a3a3; text-decoration: none; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem 5rem; }
    .feature-card { background: white; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1.5rem; }
    .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .feature-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #525252; }
    .privacy-banner { background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 2rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 4rem; text-align: center; }
    .privacy-banner h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .privacy-banner p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #1e40af; }
  </style>

  <section class="hero">
    <span class="badge">100% Local &middot; Zero Cloud</span>
    <h1>Your finances. Your device.<br/>Your eyes only.</h1>
    <p>AfLux is a financial co-pilot that runs entirely on your device &mdash; Mac, Windows, and iPhone. AI-powered tax planning, cash flow analysis, rental management, and retirement projections with military-grade encryption and zero data leaving your device.</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="/download" class="btn btn-primary">Download Free</a>
      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/aflux/id6773178204" class="btn btn-secondary">App Store</a>
      <a href="/features" class="btn btn-secondary">See Features</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="privacy-banner">
    <h2>Privacy is not a feature. It's the architecture.</h2>
    <p>No accounts. No cloud sync. No telemetry. Your data is encrypted with SQLCipher using your passphrase &mdash; even we can't see it. The AI runs locally on your device. Nothing ever leaves your machine.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Cash Flow Intelligence</h3>
      <p>Import bank statements (OFX/QFX/CSV). Auto-categorize with vendor learning. Category budgets with progress bars. 12-month cash flow forecast. Subscription detection.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Tax Planning &amp; What-If</h3>
      <p>Ingest returns and W-2s/1099s. Tax What-If Scenarios: slide 401(k), IRA, HSA, Roth conversions and see real-time tax savings. Estimated payment tracking.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Rental Management</h3>
      <p>Full Schedule E tracking with dedicated rental cash flow. Rental income and expense ledger. Tenant management, depreciation schedules, and budget/forecast.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Portfolio &amp; Fee Analyzer</h3>
      <p>Track all accounts with live quotes and tax lots. Fee Analyzer shows expense ratio drag over 30 years. Asset Allocation comparison to model portfolios.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Retirement Optimizer</h3>
      <p>Contribution optimizer shows exactly how much to put in 401(k), HSA, Roth, and IRA — with tax savings per step. Roth vs Traditional analysis. RMD schedules. "When can I retire?" solver.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>AI Assistant &amp; Document Vault</h3>
      <p>Chat with a local AI grounded in your actual data — tool-calling for precise lookups. Store leases, deeds, and policies in the document vault. Full encrypted backup in a single file.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
